<title>NEW ZEALAND: Force agrees to buy property for NZ$8 mln.</title>
<headline>Force agrees to buy property for NZ$8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinema company Force Corp Ltd said on Monday it had agreed to buy land and buildings for NZ$8 million.  </p>
<p>The conditional cash purchase is for the Civic Theatre complex in Queen Street in Auckland.</p>
<p>The agreement is conditional upon receiving development approvals on or before August 29.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
